        <mxCell id="whyBox" value="&lt;b&gt;Why it matters:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Regulators need to know which drug caused the adverse event. Cross-sectional data attributes blame to whichever drug happened to be in the patient&#39;s chart." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F6F8FC;fontColor=#3F4444;strokeColor=#CDCDCD;strokeWidth=2;fontSize=13;fontFamily=Arial;arcSize=8;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;" vertex="1" parent="1">
